; Invalid under the `geometry` bundle, on purpose.
;
; `px` is outside `distance`'s `[mm cm m km]` set. The server reports
; `unit_not_allowed`; changing the suffix to `mm`, `cm`, `m`, or `km`
; clears it. This document is also the reason the bundle is worth having:
; the `gpu-textures` bundle knows nothing about `(shape …)`, so the same
; bytes would be `unknown_form` over there.

(shape :rotation 45deg :radius 12px)
